# Mutation plan for the two auth migrations and the cloud login — validation order, the
# permission, and the refusal each ends in.
#
#   scripts/mutate-batch.sh scripts/mutations/auth-migrations.plan
#
# Tab-separated: name<TAB>file<TAB>from<TAB>to<TAB>suite<TAB>filter.  `\n` becomes a newline.
# The last two lines are the no-op controls and must SURVIVE.
# Dropped after the first batch: `from-empty-accepted` (the `!from.is_empty()` guard) survived because
# `""` is rejected by the provider list anyway — an equivalent mutant, so the guard was removed instead.

